WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.860
Gold shoots up. And often comes back.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:10.340
This is a Fair Value Gap: a gap left behind by a strong impulse.

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:17.130
Step one: the wicks of candle one and three don't overlap. The gap lies in between.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:23.000
Step two: wait for price to come back into the gap. Don't chase it.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:27.850
Step three: enter inside the gap, stop beyond it.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:34.040
Common mistake: trading every gap. Only gaps in the trend direction count.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:40.040
I show setups like this live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
